<title>USA: AAR completes acquisition of Cooper.</title>
<headline>AAR completes acquisition of Cooper.</headline>
<dateline>WOOD DALE, Ill. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>AAR Corp said Thursday it completed the acquisition of Cooper Aviation Industries Inc for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Cooper will be integrated into AAR Allen Group, which is the company's airframe parts inventory provisioning and management unit, AAR said. Cooper will do business as AAR Cooper Aviation.</p>
<p>	   -- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
